# Nakshatra needs no secrets and reads no environment variables.
#
# The server is configured with command-line flags (see `python backend/cloud_server.py --help`)
# and the Android app's server address is set in its Settings screen.
#
# This file exists so that, if configuration is ever added, the convention is in place:
# copy it to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in real values there. Never commit `.env`.
